{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EXO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"出埃及记","commonName":"出埃及记","title":"出埃及记","order":2,"numberOfChapters":40,"sha256":"11de8085569de444dbe200dc394663ee2ea45136751a33792f363f2b98b55e6f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":40,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/40.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1208},"chapter":{"number":31,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["会幕的工匠"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“看啊，我已经亲自在犹大支派中选出户珥的孙子、乌利的儿子比撒列，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["用我的灵充满他，使他有聪明智慧，精于各种技能和手艺，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["能用金、银和铜制造精巧的器具，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["又能雕刻和镶嵌宝石，精通木工和各种手艺。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我委派但支派亚希撒抹的儿子亚何利亚伯做他的助手。至于其他能工巧匠，我已赐给他们智慧，好照我对你的吩咐制造一切器具，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["即会幕、约柜和约柜上面的施恩座、会幕里面所有的器具、"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["桌子和桌上的器具、纯金的灯台和灯台的一切器具、香坛、"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["燔祭坛和坛上的一切器具、洗濯盆和盆座，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["还有精工制作的礼服，即亚伦祭司的圣衣及其众子供祭司之职时穿的礼服，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["以及膏油和圣所使用的芬芳的香。他们要照我对你的吩咐去做。”"]},{"type":"heading","content":["安息日"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶和华对摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["“你要吩咐以色列百姓务必守我的安息日，因为这是我与你们之间世世代代的记号，叫你们知道使你们圣洁的是我耶和华。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["你们要守安息日，以它为圣日。凡不守这日的，必被处死。凡在这天工作的，必从民中被铲除。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["一周要工作六天，第七天是完全休息的安息日，是耶和华的圣日。凡在安息日做工的，必被处死。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["因此，以色列人世世代代都要守安息日，作为永久的约，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["这是我和以色列人之间永久的记号。因为耶和华用六天的时间创造天地，在第七天停工休息。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["耶和华在西奈山对摩西说完这些话以后，就把自己用指头刻上诫命的两块石版交给摩西。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/31.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/32.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EXO/30.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}